    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.30PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 30.08.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2451/41 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 30 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dd9\u0dc3\u0db1\u0288\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.30No. 2451/41 \u2013 SATURDAY, AUGUST 30, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 33\n\nMy No.: NPC/LND/ACQSN/16/1/1/22.\n\nI, Dissanayake Mudiyanselage Sudarshana Dissanayake, Divisional Secretary of the Division of Nuwaragam Palatha Central in Anuradhapura District in terms of Section 33 of the Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460) hereby give notice that a sum of Rs. One Thousand (Rs. 1,000.00) being nominal compensation for the acquisition of the land described in the schedule below has been deposited in under Case No. 00008/LA/25 of the District Court of Anuradhapura to be drawn by the person entitled thereto.\n\nD.M.S. Dissanayake, Divisional Secretary, Nuwaragam Palatha Central.\n\nOn this 15th day of August, 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nName of the land : Thissawewawaththa,\n\nThissawewakumbura and\n\nThissawewahena\n\nPlan No. : F.V.P. 1401\n\nLot No. : 163\n\nExtent : 0.0047 Hectare\n\nLocation : North : Lot Nos. 131, 134 and 164;\n\nEast : Lot No. 164;\n\nSouth : Lot No. 162;\n\nWest : Lot Nos. 136 and 131.\n\nEOG 08 \u2013 0314\n\n1A \u2013 G 045266 \u2013 11 (08/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.30\n\nPART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 30.08.20252A\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 33\n\nMy No.: NPC/LND/ACQSN/16/1/1/69."
