    "chunk_text": "02. I do hereby vest in the said Secretary to the Ministry of Youth Affairs and Sports the authority to carry out and administer the functions of the aforesaid National Sports Associations/Federations pertaining to the above sports, until such time as their office-bearers are duly elected at an Annual General Meeting held under the amended Constitution of the respective Associations/Federations.\n\nAt Colombo,On this 27th day of August, 2025.\n\nEOG 08 - 0299"
