    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2451/16 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 27 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.27\n\nNo. 2451/16 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, AUGUST 27, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 My No.: MUL/LND/02/ACQ/28. Reference No. of Ministry of Lands: 4-3/5/2020/HA/21. I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for public purpose:- Description of the land to be acquired: Following allotments of land in the extent of 0.0312 Hectares and depicted as Lot No. 01 and 02 of Paper No. 1 to Zone No. 02 of the Cadastral Plan bearing No. 820432 dated 03.04.2025 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in the village of Beragama South, in the Grama Niladhari Division of Beragama South in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Mulatiyana in Matara District, Southern Province. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Dolamanga, Galgodahena; Description of the Land: Garden, There is a mixed crop cultivation; Claimant: H. H. Amarasiri; Extent: 0.0030 Hectare."
