    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'08'20Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 20.08.20254A\n\n2. Identification of Challenges and Proposal of Solutions\n\nii. Establish processes and systems for financial management, procurement, and human resource management.\n\niii. Establish ICT infrastructure for institutional operations and promptly install technology-enabled, automated, simple, and transparent systems to ensure the availability of web-based software well-being.\n\niv. Install and maintain internet and infrastructure facilities to ensure convenient access to services and hospitality-related information at relevant tourist destinations and to carry out relevant tasks.\n\nv. Ensure the protection of tourists and upgrade identified hospitals by establishing hospital wards capable of providing paid treatment at internationally accepted standards.\n\nvi. Address and resolve overlaps in institutional responsibilities, with particular attention to simplifying the overall structure.\n\nvii. Fulfil clearly defined roles and responsibilities among institutions actively and independently, while establishing effective mechanisms to facilitate inter-agency cooperation.\n\nviii. Mobilize resources in addition to the regular allocations received by tourism-related institutions.\n\nix. Coordinate among public sector institutions, private sector entities, non-governmental organizations, and other stakeholders.\n\nx. Provide strategic guidance to the Sri Lanka Institute of Tourism and Hotel Management with regard to training and development of human resources.\n\nxi. Promote the innovative tourism product development with the aim of supporting inclusive and long-term economic growth and enhancing overall societal well-being."
