    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2450/02 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 18 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dc3\u01ff\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.18 No. 2450/02 \u2013 MONDAY, AUGUST 18, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\n,, Notice under Section 7\n\nD.S. Ref No.: KES/DS/LND/AC/8/5/14. Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation Ref No.: 4-3/6/2018/HW/410. I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for a public purpose:\n\nDescription of the land or Servitude to be acquired:\n\nAllotments in total extent of about 0.0041 Hectare, of land in Preliminary Plan No. CO 9989 dated 12.08.2022 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys of Colombo District on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 581A,\n\nArawwala West in the Village of Arawwala (within the Kesbewa Urban Council Limits) in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kesbewa in Colombo District in the Western Province.\n\n01. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Assessment No. 1796, Maharagama Road; Description: Open Waste land; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: K. D. Lakshman Perera, No. 672/B5, Arawwala, Pannipitiya, (to finalize the land acquisition process) Extent: 0.0010 Hectare. 02. Lot No. 2 Name of the Land: Assessment No. Cannot be found, Maharagama Road; Description: Open Waste land; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: - (Needed to Widening the Piliyandala\u2014Maharagama Road) Extent: 0.0024 Hectare. 03. Lot No. 3 Name of the Land: Assessment No. 1689, Maharagama Road; Description: Open Waste land; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: A.A.J. Amarasinghe,\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS Land Acquisition Notices\n\n1A G 045161 - 12 (08/2025)"
