    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.12PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.08.2025\n\nTHE PILGRIMAGES ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 175)\n\nThe Esala Festival of Sabaragamu Maha Saman Devalaya - 2025\n\nI hereby notify to the General public that the aforesaid Festival will commence on the 22nd August 2025 and end on 08th September 2025.\n\nAttention of the General public is here by drawn that the regulation in terms of the provisions of the Pilgrimage Ordinance published in the following Gazette Noti\ufb01cation:\n\nGazette No. 2151/21 dated 26th November 2019Gazette No. 2184/49 dated 17th July 2020Gazette No. 2243/08 dated 30th August 2021Gazette No. 2293/45 dated 18th August 2022Gazette No. 2338/60 dated 30th June 2023Gazette No. 2390/03 dated 24th June 2024\n\nK. G. S. NISANTHA, District Secretary/Government Agent, Of\ufb01cer in Charge of the Esala Festival Camp, At the Sabaragamuwa Maha Saman Devalaya.\n\nAt the District Secretariat, Rathnapura, On 11th August, 2025.\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2449/13 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 12 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u025e\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.12\n\nNo. 2449/13 \u2013 TUESDAY, AUGUST 12, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\n1A \u2013 G 45100 \u2013 05 (08/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.12\n\nPART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.08.2025 2A\n\nThe Esala Festival of Sabaragamu Maha Saman Devalaya - 2025"
