    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.12PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.08.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2449/07 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 12 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u025e\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.12No. 2449/07 \u2013 TUESDAY, AUGUST 12, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAn allotment of below mentioned land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. CO/PDK/2021/363 dated 05.03.2022, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Arukwatta in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 460A of Arukwatta South in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Padukka in the District of Colombo in the Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Moragahathenna \u2013 Extent: 0.0113 Hectare North: Road (R.D.A.); East: Road (R.D.A.) and Lot No. 95 in P.P.Co. 9712; South: Lot Nos. 95 and 94 in\n\nP.P.Co. 9712; West: Lot Nos. 94 and 93 in P.P.Co. 9712 and Road (R.D.A.).\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/5/2020/HW/305.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.20th May, 2025.\n\nEOG 08 \u2013 0107\n\n\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under\n\n1A \u2013 G 045096 \u2013 19 (08/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk"
