    "chunk_text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under\n\n1A \u2013 G 045096 \u2013 19 (08/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.08.20252A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nSub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nThe allotments of below mentioned land Lots 05 (135 - 158) depicted in the Cadastral Map No. 320334 Block No. 04, Sheet No. 03 dated 29.06.2018, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Meevathura in the Grama Niladhari Division of Meevathura (20) in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Udunuwara in the District of Kandy in the Central Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 135 \u2013 Deniyegedarawatta \u2013 Extent:0.0004 Hectare North: Lot No. 134, Block No. 3; East: Block No. 3; South: Lot Nos. 136 and 137; West: Lot No. 137.\n\n02. Lot No. 139 \u2013 Dehigamawalawwe Watta \u2013 Extent:0.0035 Hectare North: Lot No. 25, Block No. 3; East: Block No. 3; South: Block No. 3 and Lot No. 39; West: Lot Nos. 138, 140 and 25.\n\n03. Lot No. 141 \u2013 Dehigamawalawwe Watta \u2013 Extent:0.0005 Hectare North: Lot No. 39 and Block No. 3; East: Block No. 3; South: Lot Nos. 142 and 143; West: Lot Nos. 143 and 39.\n\n04. Lot No. 153 \u2013 Dehigamawalawwe Watta \u2013 Extent:0.0052 Hectare North: Lot No. 59 and Block No. 3; East: Block No. 3; South: Block No. 3, Lot Nos. 154 and 152; West: Lot Nos. 152 and 59.\n\n05. Lot No. 158 \u2013 Kirinaidayalage Watta alias Bokumbura Watta \u2013 Extent: 0.0026 Hectare North and East: Block No. 3; South: Lot Nos. 159 and 157; West: Lot No. 157.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation."
