    "chunk_text": "III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2025.08.07 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 07.08.2025 SCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Division Map No. of Title No. Registration\n\n(Hectare) Rathmalana Aththidiya 521010 Block 07 0.0126 00042538791 Delkada North Parcel No. 48\n\nN.B.- Letters claiming a right to intestate property should mention the Cadastral Map number, parcel number and the entitlement of the claimant to claim such property. The top left-hand corner of the envelope should bear the phrase \u201cApplication for Intestate Property.\u201d\n\nEOG 08-0085/2\n\n3 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2025.08.07 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 07.08.2025\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, NO. 21 OF 1998\n\n(SECTION 55)\n\nReference the intestate property of late Mr. Jayalath Pejjalage Edman Chandrasiri who resided in the village of Meddegama West, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Mallawapitiya , in the District of Kurunegala.\n\nIt is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Mr. Jayalath Pejjalage Edman Chandrasiri in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 25th August, 2025 seting his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998. P. C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 15th July, 2025. SCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Division Map No. of Title No. Registration"
