    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.07PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 07.08.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2448/39 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 07 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.07No. 2448/39 \u2013 THURSDAY, AUGUST 07, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAcquisition of allotments of land (Kolongaswatta) for the construction of Kolongaswatta Service Reservoir of Kundasale Haragama Water Supply Project.\n\nThe allotments of land described as following names and extents, depicted in the Advance Tracing No. Maha/KND/2022/167 dated 10.02.2023, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Kengalla in the Minor Division of Udagampaha Korale in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 701 of Ihalawela in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kundasale in the District of Kandy, Central Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Kolongahawatta \u2013 Extent: 0.0633 Hectare North: Kolongahawatta claimed by B. Indrarathne, Kolongahawatta claimed by M. G. Gunasena and Kolongahawatta claimed by D. A. G. G. Chandrakanthi; East:\n\nKolongahawatta claimed by D. A. G. G. Chandrakanthi, Lot B and Kolongahawatta claimed by R. Muththulingam; South: Kolongahawatta claimed by R. Muththulingam and Kolongahawatta claimed by R. M. U. U. A. Rajapaksha; West: Kolongahawatta claimed by R. M. U. U. A. Rajapaksha and Kolongahawatta claimed by B. Indrarathne."
